  "en": {
   "name": "Social media",
   "description": "The viewers' messages on air, from YouTube, Twitch, Facebook, Instagram, X, TikTok, WhatsApp or SMS, approved by the moderation: the card of the message on air, a wall of approved messages sliding in, a \"YOUR MESSAGES\" band and the hashtag counter with its curve. Everything reads the project's Social source.", "summary": "Approved social messages: card, wall, ticker, counter."
  },
